flowchart LR
    %% J1 FNOL: portal to notification (documentary; the code is the source of truth)
    PolicyLookup[FnolWizard PolicyLookup] --> IncidentDetails[IncidentDetails]
    IncidentDetails --> DamageAndPhotos[DamageAndPhotos]
    DamageAndPhotos --> Review[Review]
    Review --> Submit[Submit]
    Submit --> API[POST /v1/claims]
    API --> Register[ClaimController.register]
    Register --> Triage[TriageService.triage]
    Triage --> Save[(claims.claim)]
    Save --> Topic>claims.registered.v1]
    Topic --> Notify[notifications ClaimRegisteredHandler]
    Notify --> SMTP[SMTP smtp.corvane.internal]
